r existing source fits a route-time grant (manual = owner-revocable mid-approval, measured 204 then approver 404; rule = reaped by the boot orphan sweep, measured revoked 1), so a distinguishable source moves packages/spec (ShareSource, contracts/sharing-service.ts:116). H4: #7345 is closed not_planned and the honest-UI half landed in objectui as objectstack-ai/objectui#5211 (link suppression probe) — it suppresses the dead link for B and C (probe 200 with 0 rows) but keeps it for A (probe 403, deliberate fail-open), where the record page's catch-all renders the may-have-been-deleted copy (code read at pin, browser NOT MEASURED). Recommendation: status quo + honest UI, conflicting with the pre-recorded preference — the conflict is stated in open_questions for the maintainer.",
