eck owed; (2) walled boot needed a scratch host root in the scratchpad declaring @objectstack/organizations (symlink to the workspace package) because ADR-0132 forbids any framework package declaring it, plus OS_AUTH_MEMBERSHIP_POLICY=invite-only (the organizations membership-policy gate refuses an undeclared policy); (3) approver membership inserted under system context + re-sign-in, not the invitation flow; (4) AuditPlugin mounted via extraPlugins (the harness does not mount it); (5) console behaviour read from objectui code at the .objectui-sha pin a58626c8 (blobless shallow fetch into the scratchpad), not driven in a browser — NOT MEASURED: where the class-A link lands; (6) hotcrm / cloud tenants not in this tree — NOT MEASURED: production demand for class B. Still waiting on this answer (the #11286 card answers 404): plugin-approvals manager-org-screen-parity.contract.test.ts pins two independent manager organization screens (approvals vs sharing) and states it holds the duplication while #7497 is open; plugin-sharing position-graph.ts:40 notes the second position-holder implementation.",
