    {
      "question": "Q2 (only if A). Which provenance does a route-time grant carry? Measured: source manual is revocable by the record owner mid-approval (204, approver back to 404) and is distinguishable from a person's grant only by granted_by null; source rule is protected from the owner (409) but reaped by sweepOrphanedRuleGrants because its source_id names no sharing rule (revoked 1, approver back to 404).",
