        "keep fail-open as ruled on objectstack-ai/objectui#5211 (dead-end link remains for class A)",
        "treat an object-level PERMISSION_DENIED probe answer as unreadable (an object-level denial discloses nothing about the record's existence) and suppress the link for class A too — an objectui change routed to the objectui seat"
