      "question": "Q6 (settled by the direction ruling). The parked duplication that waits on this card: plugin-approvals manager-org-screen-parity.contract.test.ts pins two independent manager organization screens and says it holds them apart while #7497 is open; plugin-sharing position-graph.ts:40 notes the second position-holder implementation.",
      "options": [
        "C or A ruled — routing and visibility stay separate authorities; the duplication stays deliberate and the parity pin remains the guard",
        "B ruled — the sharing model reads approval routing; unifying the two implementations becomes a follow-up"
      ],
      "recommendation": "decide it in the same ruling as Q1, so the parity pin's comment can cite the answer instead of an open card."
    }
